{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/etc/putty/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>SSH 프로토콜은 웹호스팅을 이용하거나, 리눅스서버에 접속하기 위하여 사용하는 원격접속 툴이다.</p>\n<p>PuTTY는 리눅스나 유닉스 계열의 서버에 원격으로 접속할 수 있는 클라이언트 프로그램으로 무료로 다운받을 수 있으며, 프로그램 또한 가벼워서 윈도우에서 리눅스로 SSH 프로토콜은 이용하여 접속할 때 많이 사용한다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"putty-다운로드\" style=\"position:relative;\">PuTTY 다운로드<a href=\"#putty-%EB%8B%A4%EC%9A%B4%EB%A1%9C%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"putty 다운로드 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/iPuTTY/iPuTTY/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Release.iPuTTY/iPuTTY</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/putty/latest.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Download PuTTY: latest release (0.76)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"putty-사용법\" style=\"position:relative;\">PuTTY 사용법<a href=\"#putty-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"putty 사용법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 452px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2108ba922d304cfc5a61434e9c7ee4d6/80d88/putty-01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 119.27083333333334%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/2108ba922d304cfc5a61434e9c7ee4d6/a59e9/putty-01.webp 192w,\n/static/2108ba922d304cfc5a61434e9c7ee4d6/0ca9f/putty-01.webp 384w,\n/static/2108ba922d304cfc5a61434e9c7ee4d6/a0edd/putty-01.webp 452w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/2108ba922d304cfc5a61434e9c7ee4d6/3b721/putty-01.png 192w,\n/static/2108ba922d304cfc5a61434e9c7ee4d6/66595/putty-01.png 384w,\n/static/2108ba922d304cfc5a61434e9c7ee4d6/80d88/putty-01.png 452w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/2108ba922d304cfc5a61434e9c7ee4d6/80d88/putty-01.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\r\n<em>PuTTY 실행 화면</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Host Name 에 서버의 ip주소나 도메인 주소를 입력한다.</li>\n<li>텔넷, SSH 등 많이 사용하는 프로토콜의 경우 ‘Connection type’에 위치하고 있어 클릭을 하면 자동으로 해당 프로토콜의 기본 포트가 입력된다.</li>\n<li>서버 주소와 포트를 설정했다면, 다음에 접속하기 쉽게 ‘저장’을 한다. 이 때 서버 주소는 물론 환경 설정까지 모두 저장되므로 폰트 변경이나 창 사이즈 변경 등 환경 설정에 변화가 있을 경우 여기에서 다시 저장을 하면 된다.</li>\n<li>처음 환경 설정을 저장할 때 Saved Sessions 칸에 적당한 이름을 입력하고 아래의 Save 버튼을 클릭하면 저장되며, 기존에 저장되어 있는 경우 해당 이름을 선택한 후 Save 버튼을 클릭하면 환경 설정이 덮어쓰기 된다.</li>\n<li>선택 후 Open버튼을 누르면 Shell창이 뜬다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/55bfd/putty-02.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 58.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/a59e9/putty-02.webp 192w,\n/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/0ca9f/putty-02.webp 384w,\n/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/dc9b9/putty-02.webp 768w,\n/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/80d25/putty-02.webp 811w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/3b721/putty-02.png 192w,\n/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/66595/putty-02.png 384w,\n/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/fe486/putty-02.png 768w,\n/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/55bfd/putty-02.png 811w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/488b66bd9f14cde5d49fb6b2a4e2d7b9/fe486/putty-02.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>login as: 부분에 서버아이디를 입력하고 엔터를 치면 비밀번호를 입력할 수 있다.<br>\n서버FTP 비밀번호를 입력하여 서버에 접속한다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/55bfd/putty-03.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 58.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/a59e9/putty-03.webp 192w,\n/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/0ca9f/putty-03.webp 384w,\n/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/dc9b9/putty-03.webp 768w,\n/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/80d25/putty-03.webp 811w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/3b721/putty-03.png 192w,\n/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/66595/putty-03.png 384w,\n/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/fe486/putty-03.png 768w,\n/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/55bfd/putty-03.png 811w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/aee011ffaf0ee8826b68675d7f060402/fe486/putty-03.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>서버에 접속 후 mysql 정보를 입력하여 DB에 접속한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"첨부파일\" style=\"position:relative;\">첨부파일<a href=\"#%EC%B2%A8%EB%B6%80%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC\" aria-label=\"첨부파일 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/367f6ec0c1c122a16ff8644c14b79b6c/HangulPuTTY-0.60h.setup.zip\">HangulPuTTY-0.60h.setup.zip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/7e210603d065b95e168abfaff5e88d7c/putty.zip\">putty.zip</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"참고\" style=\"position:relative;\">참고<a href=\"#%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\"참고 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/jeonsr/221792705148\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SSH 접속프로그램 PuTTY 사용법</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#putty-%EB%8B%A4%EC%9A%B4%EB%A1%9C%EB%93%9C\">PuTTY 다운로드</a></p>\n</li>\n<